{# Heap-lock common impl: included only on RTOSes where we actually
   apply --wrap (FreeRTOS, NuttX).  Zephyr+zeroheap has zero kernel
   heap by design (audited at link time); pulling the wrap chain in
   triggers a picolibc-vs-Zephyr-libc multiple-malloc-definition
   error since both archives ship `malloc` and our weak __real_malloc
